WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.016
Roxy tapped Terrell on the shoulder.

2
00:00:05.017 --> 00:00:07.436
"I'll be back soon," she whispered.

3
00:00:07.437 --> 00:00:09.859
"I have to go to the space station."

4
00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:16.375
Terrell's eyes went wide. "Wow! Good luck!"

5
00:00:16.376 --> 00:00:19.069
Roxy hurried away from the playground.

6
00:00:19.070 --> 00:00:23.023
She shot into the sky.

7
00:00:23.024 --> 00:00:27.997
"Look!" Mara pointed. "Rocket Girl!"

8
00:00:27.998 --> 00:00:39.969
Soon Roxy was in space. Her watch beeped.

9
00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:42.318
"Detective Smith," Roxy said.

10
00:00:42.319 --> 00:00:47.480
"Is there a problem on Earth? Is it being invaded by aliens?"

11
00:00:47.481 --> 00:00:50.924
"No, Rocket Girl," the detective said.

12
00:00:50.925 --> 00:00:53.291
"I just wanted to say good luck.

13
00:00:53.292 --> 00:00:58.736
My brother, Commander Smith, is on the space station. I hope he's okay."

14
00:00:58.737 --> 00:01:01.849
"I didn't know you had a brother," Roxy said.

15
00:01:01.850 --> 00:01:05.862
Detective Smith nodded. "We're twins."

16
00:01:05.863 --> 00:01:08.847
Just then Roxy saw the space station.

17
00:01:08.848 --> 00:01:12.315
"Whew!" she said. "Good news, Detective.

18
00:01:12.316 --> 00:01:14.917
The space station wasn't destroyed.

19
00:01:14.918 --> 00:01:19.810
I'll find out why the Space Agency lost contact with it."

20
00:01:19.811 --> 00:01:23.935
Roxy closed her watch and entered the space station.

21
00:01:23.936 --> 00:01:27.343
It looked empty.

22
00:01:27.344 --> 00:01:30.340
"Where is everyone?" Roxy thought.

23
00:01:30.341 --> 00:01:33.540
"And where is all the equipment?"

24
00:01:33.541 --> 00:01:38.203
"Hello?" she called out. "Is anyone here?"

25
00:01:38.204 --> 00:01:41.006
An astronaut peeked out from a hatch.

26
00:01:41.007 --> 00:01:43.814
Her name tag said Dr. Chen.

27
00:01:43.815 --> 00:01:47.504
"Officer Wells! Come on out!" Dr. Chen said.

28
00:01:47.505 --> 00:01:50.018
"Rocket Girl is here!"

29
00:01:50.019 --> 00:01:55.966
A second astronaut came into the room.

30
00:01:55.967 --> 00:01:58.845
"We're so glad you're here, Rocket Girl!"

31
00:01:58.846 --> 00:02:01.306
"What happened?" Roxy asked.

32
00:02:01.307 --> 00:02:05.202
"The Space Agency lost contact with you."

33
00:02:05.203 --> 00:02:09.519
Dr. Chen looked at Officer Wells and sighed.

34
00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:13.942
"All of our communication equipment is gone," she said.

35
00:02:13.943 --> 00:02:17.856
"Phones, computers . . . gone!"

36
00:02:17.857 --> 00:02:20.781
"I don't understand," Roxy said.

37
00:02:20.782 --> 00:02:23.242
"Where did the equipment go?"

38
00:02:23.243 --> 00:02:27.693
"Well . . . " Officer Wells chuckled nervously.

39
00:02:27.694 --> 00:02:30.897
"We found a creature in a spaceship.

40
00:02:30.898 --> 00:02:32.072
He was really cute.

41
00:02:32.073 --> 00:02:33.420
Small and furry.

42
00:02:33.421 --> 00:02:34.953
I named him Furbit.

43
00:02:34.954 --> 00:02:37.741
Unfortunately, um . . . "

44
00:02:37.742 --> 00:02:39.657
Dr. Chen glared at him.

45
00:02:39.658 --> 00:02:42.382
"Furbit ate everything!"

46
00:02:42.383 --> 00:02:44.251
Officer Wells looked down.

47
00:02:44.252 --> 00:02:48.784
"It was my fault. I brought Furbit into the space station."

48
00:02:48.785 --> 00:02:52.750
He frowned. "Commander Smith won't be happy."

49
00:02:52.751 --> 00:02:55.691
"Where is the commander?" Roxy asked.

50
00:02:55.692 --> 00:02:58.199
"I don't know," Dr. Chen said.

51
00:02:58.200 --> 00:03:02.024
"I looked for him a little while ago. But I couldn't find him."

52
00:03:02.025 --> 00:03:05.467
"Wait here." Roxy headed toward a door.

53
00:03:05.468 --> 00:03:08.616
"Where are you going?" Dr. Chen asked.

54
00:03:08.617 --> 00:03:11.631
"I'm going to catch Furbit," Roxy said.

55
00:03:11.632 --> 00:03:15.689
Officer Wells looked shocked. "That won't be easy!"

56
00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:17.955
"What do you mean?" Roxy asked.

57
00:03:17.956 --> 00:03:20.673
"You said Furbit is small and furry."

58
00:03:20.674 --> 00:03:25.448
Boom! Boom! The space station shook.

59
00:03:25.449 --> 00:03:28.677
"Oof!" Officer Wells tumbled into Dr. Chen.

60
00:03:28.678 --> 00:03:33.859
Roxy bumped her head. "What was that?"

61
00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:40.067
Dr. Chen gulped. "That was Furbit!"

